    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>10:00AM-11:00AM</td>
      <td>
<strong>CXL2/CXL3 coherency deep dive</strong><br>  <a href="/assets/program/tutorials/CXL/Hot%20Chips%202022%20CXL3%20Coherence%20Deep%20Dive.pdf"><i class="fa fa-file-pdf fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> <a href="https://youtu.be/pHuHUeSmGGk?t=2364" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-file-video fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
</td>
      <td>Robert Blankenship,  Intel</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>11:00AM-11:45AM</td>
      <td>
<strong>Memory use cases and challenges</strong><br>  <a href="/assets/program/tutorials/CXL/Hot%20Chips%202022%20CXL%20MemoryChallenges.pdf"><i class="fa fa-file-pdf fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> <a href="https://youtu.be/pHuHUeSmGGk?t=5865" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-file-video fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
</td>
      <td>Prakash Chauhan &amp; Mahesh Wagh,  Meta &amp; AMD</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>11:45AM-12:30PM</td>
      <td>
<strong>CXL3 Fabric introduction &amp; use cases</strong><br>  <a href="/assets/program/tutorials/CXL/Hot%20Chips%202022%20CXL3%20Fabric%20Intro%20and%20use%20cases.pdf"><i class="fa fa-file-pdf fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> <a href="https://youtu.be/pHuHUeSmGGk?t=9471" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-file-video fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
</td>
      <td>Tony Brewer &amp; Nathan Kalyanasundharam,  Micron &amp; AMD</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>12:30PM-1:30PM</td>
      <td>
<em>Break (1 hr)</em><br>
</td>
      <td> </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>1:30PM-5:00PM</td>
      <td>
<em>Heterogeneous Compilation in MLIR</em><br> <br>Chair: Stephen Neuendorffer, AMD</td>
      <td> </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td> </td>
      <td>
<strong>Intro</strong><br>  <a href="/assets/program/tutorials/MLIR/HotchipsMLIRTutorialIntroFinal.pdf"><i class="fa fa-file-pdf fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> <a href="https://youtu.be/VFexAjUoTZI" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-file-video fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
</td>
      <td>Stephen Neuendorffer,  AMD</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>1:30PM-2:15PM</td>
      <td>
<strong>Basic Concepts</strong><br>  <a href="/assets/program/tutorials/MLIR/HC2022.Google.Pienaar.v1.pdf"><i class="fa fa-file-pdf fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> <a href="https://youtu.be/VFexAjUoTZI?t=215" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-file-video fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
</td>
