      <td>
<strong>ML Frontends and frameworks</strong><br>  <a href="/assets/program/tutorials/MLIR/HC34.Arm.SurajSudhir.v03.pdf"><i class="fa fa-file-pdf fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> <a href="https://youtu.be/VFexAjUoTZI?t=6232" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-file-video fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
